l's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Figaro Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\">Figaro Pennygood</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sticky_Dondo\" title=\"Sticky Dondo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/25px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/38px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/50px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sticky Dondo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/25px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sticky_Dondo\" title=\"Sticky Dondo\">Sticky Dondo</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Tollhouse\" title=\"Reithwin Tollhouse\">Reithwin Tollhouse</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-107&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-105</span> – there are 2 inside the Heavy Chest in the cart</li></ul>\n</div>     <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"3D_Preview\"> 3D Preview </span></h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://faeruncolors.com/#dye=jet-and-pink-rose\">Full-screen 3D model preview</a> on <i>FaerûnColors</i>\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><details class=\"bg3wiki-dye-preview\"><summary><span>Embed 3D model preview</span></summary>\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" width=\"280\" height=\"500\" style=\"border:none\" src=\"https://faeruncolors.com/embed/jet-and-pink-rose?compact\" title=\"Jet and Pink Rose 3D preview\"></iframe></details> \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 334px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 332px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Examples of dye on various materials.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png/498px-Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png/748px-Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/8f/Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Examples of dye on various materials.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png/498px-Jet_and_Pink_Rose_-_Sample.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"332\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Jet_and_Pink_R